        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5tr",
          "text": "Construction is an inherently dangerous industry, with many elements and heavy machinery that could cause serious worker injuries. However, many construction site accidents in Denver are preventable. They occur when one or more parties are negligent or fall short of the expectations of care.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
