    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5tw",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5tv",
          "text": "Construction accidents can be extremely physically and emotionally devastating. Many of these accidents cause catastrophic and permanent injuries, such as brain damage and paralysis. Construction site accident victims can sustain many serious injuries, such as:",
