    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5ur",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l5uo",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/denver-wrongful-death-lawyer/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5un",
          "text": "After being injured in a construction site accident, you may have the right to file one or more types of claims in the pursuit of financial compensation. The law in Colorado provides workers’ compensation benefits without having to prove fault, for example, to injured construction workers who are classified as employees. If someone is at fault for causing the accident, however, the injured victim could seek compensation through a personal injury or ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5up",
          "text": "wrongful death",
          "marks": [
            "l5uo"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5uq",
          "text": " lawsuit. Discuss your legal options with an attorney for more information.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5ut",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5us",
          "text": "Who Can Be Held Liable?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5uv",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5uu",
          "text": "Holding someone liable, or legally and financially responsible, for a construction site accident in Denver requires identifying who or what caused the victim’s injuries first. The person or party most at fault for causing the accident is typically who must pay. The liable party could be:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5ux",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5uw",
          "text": "The construction company for inadequately training or protecting its workers and the public.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5v1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l5uz",
          "_type": "link",
