        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5uy",
          "text": "A property owner or the controller of the job site for a ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5v0",
          "text": "dangerous premises.",
          "marks": [
            "l5uz"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5v3",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5v2",
          "text": "A third party, such as a contractor, subcontractor or the manufacturer of a piece of faulty construction equipment.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5v5",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5v4",
          "text": "Bringing an injury claim with assistance from a construction accident lawyer could allow you to seek compensation from one or multiple parties. If you aren’t sure who caused your construction industry accident, consult with an attorney.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5v7",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5v6",
          "text": "Damages Available",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5v9",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5v8",
          "text": "Filing a construction accident claim in Denver isn’t just about recovering financial compensation; it also gives the injured victim the chance to hold a negligent party accountable and push for safety changes on an institutional level. However, the financial award that could be recovered with a successful construction accident claim can go a long way toward helping a worker plan for the future.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
