      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5vy",
          "text": "Before you rush into a fast settlement agreement with an insurance company, consult with an attorney to determine the value of your claim. While an insurance company may try to underestimate how much your case is worth, you can trust an attorney to give you an accurate evaluation. The value of your construction accident case will depend on factors such as the gravity of your personal injury and the insurance coverage available.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5w1",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5w0",
          "text": "How a Construction Accident Attorney in Denver Can Help",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5w3",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5w2",
          "text": "You don’t have to go through the complicated legal process alone after suffering an injury in a Denver construction site accident. Hiring an attorney who has experience with this type of claim can help you seek justice without the hassle. You can trust your lawyer to take over the legal process for you while you focus on healing and recovering. This includes investigating your construction accident, speaking to witnesses, hiring qualified experts, gathering evidence, telling your story in a compelling way and negotiating with an insurance provider for a fair settlement.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5w5",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5w4",
          "text": "Contact Us Today",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5w7",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5w6",
          "text": "If you or someone you love has been injured in a recent construction accident in Denver, Colorado, contact the attorneys at Dormer Harpring, LLC for a free consultation. We have the case experience and knowledge of construction accidents for a strong claim to damages. Our accident lawyers will stand by you during a compensation claim or injury lawsuit to pursue the results that you deserve.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
